            "detailed_description": "<h1>Roteiro</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688540/extras/3a3a132c2a133604cb217d943fe72c55.avif?t=1728295321\" width=600 height=1342 /></span></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688540/extras/268402ab55033a78cfbcefa667c4f031.poster.avif?t=1728295321\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688540/extras/268402ab55033a78cfbcefa667c4f031.webm?t=1728295321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688540/extras/268402ab55033a78cfbcefa667c4f031.mp4?t=1728295321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Welcome to the world of ZOMBIE RAID — an atmospheric PvP top-down shooter, where the intensity of battles merges with the strategic depth of character progression. Immerse yourself in a dynamic survival world where every shot, every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REALISTIC BALLISTICS:</strong><br>Master the art of precise shooting in conditions of realistic ballistics. Each shot becomes crucial, and your shooting skills are vital in the midst of chaos and a zombie apocalypse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OBSTACLE PENETRATION:</strong><br>Break through cover using an advanced obstacle penetration system. Strategically use the environment, knowing that bullets realistically pierce obstacles, unveiling new tactical possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAS PROPAGATION:</strong><br>Engage in tactical gameplay with advanced gas dispersion and smoke simulation that adds a strategic element to every encounter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688540/extras/413f24ac1bb8d3ae0dadb3f948eaf555.poster.avif?t=1728295321\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688540/extras/413f24ac1bb8d3ae0dadb3f948eaf555.webm?t=1728295321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688540/extras/413f24ac1bb8d3ae0dadb3f948eaf555.mp4?t=1728295321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEAPON UPGRADES:</strong><br>Customize and upgrade your arsenal with a comprehensive weapon upgrade system. Transform your favorite weapons into instruments of mass destruction tailored for your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHARACTER SKILLS:</strong><br>Customize your character to your preferred playstyle with a diverse set of personal perks. Choose from various abilities that amplify your strengths and compensate for weaknesses, creating a unique and personalized build..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIVERSE CHARACTERS:</strong> <br>Choose from four distinct characters, each with a unique playstyle and abilities: <br>        ▫ <strong>RIFLEMAN:</strong> Frontline warrior with proficiency in armor and heavy weaponry. <br>        ▫ <strong>SNIPER:</strong> Master of precision shooting and stealth, eliminating enemies from a distance. <br>        ▫ <strong>ENGINEER:</strong> Tactical expert with skills in setting traps and fortifications. <br>        ▫ <strong>MEDIC:</strong> Key support, capable of healing and reviving teammates on the brink of death. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688540/extras/9eac27b5903ee2275935179007a30a8a.poster.avif?t=1728295321\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688540/extras/9eac27b5903ee2275935179007a30a8a.webm?t=1728295321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688540/extras/9eac27b5903ee2275935179007a30a8a.mp4?t=1728295321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>GAME MODES</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAID: ( NOT AVAILABLE, Works in progress )</strong><br>Raid infected city, kill zombies and collect loot. Beware of other raiders on your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SQUAD COMBAT:</strong><br>Unite in squads of four, where each character contributes to victory with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEATHMATCH:</strong><br>Showcase your unique character build in a &quot;everyone for themselves&quot; mode, where selected perks and upgraded weapons can turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUEL: ( NOT AVAILABLE, Works in progress )</strong><br>Test your abilities in one-on-one PvP duels, demonstrating the strength of your chosen playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HORDE:</strong><br>Cooperate with other players, using both upgraded weapons and personal perks to withstand endless waves of zombies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/688540/extras/38cc483488ddd2692b30e63a21454d58.avif?t=1728295321\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p></li></ul>",
