                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game currently has several issues that impact its playability. It is riddled with bugs and often feels unresponsive. One significant problem is the inability to swap weapons while running. Additionally, the load-out selection appears to be ineffective, and there are recurring bugs when choosing a load-out and class. Although the concept of the game is promising, I cannot recommend it in its current state.However, since it is still in early access, I will update my review once these issues are resolved.\n\nPlease be aware that there may be numerous fake positive reviews. Exercise caution before making a purchase.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1720796959,
